{"version":1,"content":"<p>方東昇、黃曉瑩及李嘉嘉主持的10集《醫生，你有病？</p><p>》，昨晚（16日）迎來最後一集。</p><p>終章由已故骨科醫生黃詠儀感人個案作結，為這趟走進醫者心靈深處旅程，寫下圓滿溫暖的句號。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T12:19:11.573481+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":86,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T11:35:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T04:37:34.254936+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T12:17:35.195784+00:00","content_hash":"59394240f27369d7748a6205e51e07093fe8cb362b1acbc75ac5e91004403ca9","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}